== Notes ==
* He will charm a nearby level 15 [[Elder]] [[Crocodile]].
* Even though he uses a monster skill form of [[Charm Animal]], you can only capture the regular version from him.
* The [[Game updates/20080110|January 10th, 2008]] update fixed a [[bug]] that prevented Dzabel Land Guardian from [[spawn]]ing.

